WEBVTT

NOTE
This is a caption file for "BookReview Platform: Getting Started"
Created: August 31, 2025
Last Updated: August 31, 2025

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Welcome to the BookReview Platform, your new home 
for discovering great books and sharing your literary experiences.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:18.000
In this quick start guide, we'll walk you through creating your account,
navigating the platform, and writing your first review.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.000
Let's get started!

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:40.000
First, let's create your account. Click the "Sign Up" button 
in the upper right corner of the homepage.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Enter your name, email address, and create a password.
You can also sign up using your Google or Facebook account.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:55.000
Click one of the social login buttons
if you prefer to use those services.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:05.000
After clicking "Create Account," you'll receive a verification email.
Click the link in that email to verify your account.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Once verified, you'll be taken to your profile setup page,
where you can add a profile picture, bio, and select favorite book genres.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Adding your favorite genres helps us provide
personalized book recommendations right from the start.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Now let's explore how to navigate the BookReview Platform.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:40.000
The main navigation menu gives you quick access to key areas.
The "Home" button returns you to this main page from anywhere.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:50.000
The "Browse Books" section lets you explore our extensive
collection by genre, author, or publication date.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:02:00.000
You can use these filters to narrow down your search.
For example, let's look for recently published science fiction books.

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:10.000
You can also use the search bar at the top of any page
to directly search for books, authors, or other readers.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:15.000
Let's search for "Project Hail Mary" by Andy Weir.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:25.000
Clicking on any book will take you to its detailed page,
where you can see information, ratings, and reviews.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:40.000
Here you can see the book's cover, synopsis, author information,
publication details, and genre classifications.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Below the book details, you'll find the average rating,
rating distribution, and reviews from other readers.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:10.000
Ready to share your thoughts about a book you've read?
Click the "Write a Review" button on any book detail page.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:20.000
First, select your rating by clicking on the stars.
Then write your review in the text box below.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:35.000
Your review can be as brief or detailed as you'd like.
You can also add images related to the book.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:45.000
When you're satisfied with your review, click the "Submit" button.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:04:00.000
Congratulations! You've just published your first review.
Others can now like or comment on it, and it will appear on your profile.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:10.000
As you rate and review more books,
your personalized recommendations will become more accurate.

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:20.000
Visit your profile page to track your reading activity,
manage your book lists, and connect with other readers.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:25.000
If you need any help, click the Help icon to access
our comprehensive user guides, video tutorials, and FAQs.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:30.000
Thank you for joining the BookReview Platform!
Happy reading, and we look forward to seeing your reviews.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:40.000
For more tutorials, visit our Help Center
or subscribe to our YouTube channel.
